      {
        "id": 1,
        "type": "exploration",
        "rewards": [],
        "description": [
          {
            "list": "numbered",
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "Now that the spider is defeated, it is now gone, hence making you able to proceed."
              },
              {
                "text": "The path that comes next gets you trapped on a ground that is sticky, with the spider approaching to you from behind and then trapping you from its web."
              },
              {
                "text": "Try to wiggle around with the arrow keys to break free, then to move forward."
              },
              {
                "text": "Next, there are three obstacles to face:",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "list": "numbered",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "The first obstacle is a pit at the bottom of a downward slope."
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "The second obstacle is a boulder blocking your path.",
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "list": "bullet",
                            "items": [
                              {
                                "text": "You have to push it forward."
                              },
                              {
                                "text": "Once it starts rolling by itself, hop back to avoid the tree that will eventually fall down."
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "The third is a large boulder across a spiked pit.",
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "list": "bullet",
                            "items": [
                              {
                                "text": "What you should do is place yourself slightly nea the center of the boulder so that it can slowly roll forward."
                              },
                              {
                                "text": "When the boulder reaches the end of the pit, the next jump will slide further away from the spider, and break you free of the webs."
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
